      "extract": "[]{#sec:intro label=\"sec:intro\"} The Standard Model (SM) provides an extremely succesful and simple means of classifying and understanding the physical processes which fill the Universe. However the existence of many seemingly arbitrary features hints at a more fundamental physical theory from which the SM arises. Considering the successful series of ideas leading through molecules, to atoms, nuclei, nucleons, and",
